<item><title>Mali helps return 130 people to Burkina Faso and Ghana</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-helps-return-130-people-to-burkina-faso-and-ghana-77482a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-helps-return-130-people-to-burkina-faso-and-ghana-77482a/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>Burkina Faso sent a bus for 123 people on 19 November, while Ghana arranged transport for seven of its citizens.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:09:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
